      "category": "news",
      "content": "\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"\u003e🇹🇷☪️ \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTÜRKİYE DİYANET BAKANLIĞI\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eResmî Bildiri No. 001 — Diriliş ve Sabır Üzerine\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBİSMİLLAHİRRAHMANİRRAHİM\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"\u003eAziz Türk milleti, kıymetli silah arkadaşlarım ve ekran başında savaş emirlerini bekleyen mümin kardeşlerim…\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"\u003eBugün haritamız yoktur. Topraklarımız işgal altındadır. Bayrağımız görünmez olmuş olabilir.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"\u003eLakin unutmayınız:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHARİTADAN SİLİNMEK, TARİHTEN SİLİNMEK DEMEK DEĞİLDİR!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"\u003eAllah sabredenlerle beraberdir. Biz de sabredeceğiz. Birliğimizi koruyacağız. Dualarımızı eksik etmeyeceğiz.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"\u003eGürcü ve Ermeni kardeşlerimize de bir hatırlatmamız vardır:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"\u003eBugün haritada yerimiz olmayabilir. Fakat bu, diplomatik temsilciliğimizin kapandığı anlamına gelmez.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"\u003eBiz daha önce de zor günler gördük. Daha önce de imkânsız denileni başardık.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"\u003eŞimdi bütün Türk oyuncularına sesleniyorum:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eABDESTİNİZİ ALIN. DUANIZI EDİN. SAVAŞ EMİRLERİNİZİ KONTROL EDİN.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"\u003eZira tevekkül, gerekli hazırlıkları yaptıktan sonra Allah’a güvenmektir. Şifrenizi unutup saldırı emrini kaçırdıktan sonra mucize beklemek değildir.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"\u003eEy Türk milleti!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"\u003eBugün sabır günüdür.\u003cbr\u003eYarın teşkilatlanma günüdür.\u003cbr\u003eÖbür gün ise… Allah kerimdir. Önce online olanları bir sayalım.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTANRI TÜRK’Ü KORUSUN. ALLAH YARDIMCIMIZ OLSUN.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"\u003eVe unutmayın:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBİR TÜRK’ÜN DUASI, BİN TANE DİPLOMATİK MESAJDAN DAHA UZUNDUR.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eTürkiye Diyanet Bakanlığı\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eDinî İşler, Millî Moral ve Acil Durumlarda Grup Sohbeti Yönetimi Başkanlığı\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"\u003e 🇹🇷☪️\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
